00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:41.550
That's just what happened

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.650
when the FDIC took over
Silicon Valley Bank,

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:45.390
renamed it Silicon Valley Bridge Bank,

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:46.950
that's what's happening now.

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:49.260
First Citizens is a North
Carolina based bank.

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:50.093
They're gonna take over

00:02:50.093 --> 00:02:52.650
all 17 branches of Silicon Valley Bank.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:53.700
That's big news.

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:57.660
First Citizen stock is up 43% at the open.

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:59.670
This will be the best
day for First Citizens

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:01.743
in a very, very long time.

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:05.280
FDIC estimating the cost of the failure

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:08.040
of Silicon Valley Bank to
its deposit insurance fund

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.023
will be approximately $20 billion.

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:13.110
This move right now is
sending markets higher.

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:15.300
We're seeing global stocks up right now.

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:17.250
The DAX in Germany filling some relief

