on some of these Deutsche Bank worries.

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:19.980
That's up big.

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:21.780
The S&amp;P, the Dow, NASDAQ,

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:23.850
all up, a little under 1% right now,

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:25.590
but moving in a positive direction.

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:28.230
Remember, Credit Suisse
