That says how many people
are signing contracts

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.510
before they actually buy the house,

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:39.420
but when you go under contract.

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:41.010
This report is gonna
tell us how many people

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:43.920
