in the last month,

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:45.540
and if that number is picking up,

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.370
well, that shows you
overall across the board,

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:49.410
housing is picking up,
people are spending,

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:51.000
they're doing the opposite
of what the Fed wants.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.490
May mean the Fed has to be more vigilant

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:54.780
